<title>USA: Tuesday Morning sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Tuesday Morning sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday Morning Corp said on Tuesday that its board approved a three-for-two common stock split.  </p>
<p>The company said the split will take the form of a stock dividend payable to holders of record on Tuesday, June 3. It did not  say when the new shares would be distributed.</p>
<p>Tuesday Morning operates a chain of discount, closeout gift shops.</p>
